        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "处理工作中的「求职」，需要明确分工和时间安排。",
       "alumno": "Dealing with «job hunting» at work requires clarifying responsibilities and timelines.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "遇到变化时，及时沟通通常比等到最后补救更有效。",
       "alumno": "When circumstances change, communicating in time is usually more effective than improvising at the end.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "比较几种办法时，可以先说明各自的优点和不足。",
